      "value": "Does it really matter so much to you? This is VRChat, not Tinder :) Would you get a massive shock if I tell you that my own fav avatar is female? What should I \"check off\" if I log in with my robot avatar? Likewise, it should be to the user's discretion whether they would want to reveal their gender or whatever personal details, and sure not \"forced\" like you propose. In VR, no one cares about your \"real\" identity :) If you do, I think you have the wrong approach to it...",
