      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5ac4fd763f8d523278a414f7|full_name}: Well, in this case, the pronouns «he» and «she» also need to be removed from our speech, because they also point to the gender of the interlocutor. Instead, we will use the pronoun «it». Right? We will prohibit also the usage of male and female names in the game, because they also indicate the gender of the interlocutor. Instead, we will use neutral names. Right? In addition, the rank of users in the game: «visitor», «user», «trusted used», etc., also need to be abolished, because this is also a classification and discrimination. Right?\n\nOur society is consist of men and women and VRChat is not exception. Since it is difficult to determine the gender of the interlocutor by the appearance of the avatar, a special character is needed. I want to know in advance what kind of people are around me and with whom I will talk. This is not a classification, but information about who is standing in front of me. If you state that the gender of the interlocutor does not play any role for you, then why are you so afraid of entering gender symbols? You will simply ignore this additional information.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
