      "value": "@{5b52ba672b29a515be8ff219|full_name}: i dont want to show off my gender. Look.. vrchat is not real life and you can be whoever you want to be without too many prejudices. That would change that.\n\nAnd i know, that english is not gender neutral... it will never be and doesn't have to be...\n\nIf you'd want to know the gender of somebody you can just ask them. I bet almost everybody will give you a legitimate answer.",
