      "value": "@{5ac4fd763f8d523278a414f7|full_name}: The girl wants to talk about the French fashion with another girl. She sees a lot of female avatars around her.\n\nShe comes to the 1st female avatar:\n— Hello. Are you a woman?\n— No.\n\nShe comes the 2nd female avatar:\n— Hello. Are you a woman?\n— No.\n. . . . . . . . . . .\n. . . . . . . . . . .\nShe comes to the 10th female avatar:\n— Hello. Are you a woman?\n— Yes.\n— Oh yea-a-a-h!!! Real woman!!! I am so tired of these sweaty, smelly rednecks wearing women's avatars! Let's talk about the French fashion!",
      "viewerReactions": null
