      "value": "@{5b52ba672b29a515be8ff219|full_name}: I see nothing wrong with forcing a person that thinks any guy wearing a female avatar is a smelly redneck, who could never have an interest in french fashion, to have to put in extra effort to maintain their bigoted and narrow-minded viewpoint.\n\nAnd you're not fooling anyone here. You're deathly afraid you might accidentally make romantic advances towards a dude, and you're hoping that by forcing everyone to specify their gender when they open an account you'll be protected to some degree. You made that obvious when you referred to anyone who would choose to mark themselves as the opposite gender a pervert. \n\nFortunately for those of us who are open-minded, and unfortunately for you, your idea would never work because people can create multiple accounts, and anyone who chooses to spend much of their time in the game presenting themselves as the opposite gender would simply create another account to circumvent it.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
