      "value": "@{5c63e361af367f1a380aab08|full_name}: When you register in any social network, you provide various information about yourself and your gender too. This information is displayed in your profile and is visible to other community members. Why don't you want it to be in VRChat too? Your hysterical reaction is not clear to me.",
