      "value": "@{5b52ba672b29a515be8ff219|full_name}: I don't think displaying one's gender is discrimination. \n\nI think forcing people to display their gender so you can discriminate against them is discrimination. \n\nAnd I think denying one the ability to change their gender after they register an account, as transgender people would often need to do to fit with their new identity, is discrimination. \n\nAnd referring to people who choose to identify as another gender as perverts, as you did below? Well, that's simply abhorrent.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
